OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for many,
OL,6,Fturning slightly cloudier into the
OL,7,Fafternoon yet still with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunny spells on offer. Feeling cooler
OL,9,Fthan yesterday, although temperatures
OL,10,Fwill be close to average for the time
OL,11,Fof year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSkies turn cloudier from the
OL,14,Feast overnight, with perhaps the odd
OL,15,Flight shower. Chillier under clearer
OL,16,Fskies further west, with a touch of
OL,17,Ffrost and mist and fog in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
