OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FPatchy cloud with sunny
OL,6,Fspells throughout the day on Tuesday,
OL,7,Fwith perhaps the odd light shower
OL,8,Ffirst thing. Temperatures, around
OL,9,Faverage and feeling similar to
OL,10,Fyesterday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FRemaining largely dry and settled over
OL,14,Fthe next few days, with sunny spells.
OL,15,FBreezier on Wednesday, making it feel
OL,16,Frather chilly despite temperatures
OL,17,Fremaining close to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
